  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Construction of South Klang Valley Expressway Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at constructing a 51.2 km three_lane dual carriageway, to be upgraded gradually along with traffic growth. It will include nine interchanges and six toll plazas. It will be divided into 4 main sections.  Section lA was successfully completed in Year 2001 by Gadek_Perspec Consortium Sdn Bhd as the originator of the Expressway under Design &amp; Build Contract with the Government of Malaysia. Therefore, only three sections are to be built as part of the proposed project. The Expressway is designed and will be constructed to meet international standards. The toll system will be a closed toll system.</narrative>
  </description>
